Package: scroll
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Single-Cell Explorers from Seurat Objects
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Shihan", "Li", email = "shihanli1992@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns a processed Seurat object into a polished, interactive
    single-cell explorer (a Shiny app with DimPlot, FeaturePlot and DotPlot
    panels, each with its own controls). A heavy offline build phase extracts
    lightweight on-disk artifacts (metadata and embeddings as a small Parquet
    table, expression as a feature-partitioned Parquet store) that the app reads
    one feature at a time via duckdb, so runtime memory stays flat regardless of
    matrix size.
